OL,3,GNEWSACapita pension wait 'worst
OL,4,Aexperience of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic sector workers have described
OL,7,Fdelays to their pension payments as
OL,8,F"offensive" and "the worst experience",
OL,9,Famid a public spending watchdog review.
OL,11,FSince operator Capita Public Services
OL,12,Ftook over the Civil Service Pension
OL,13,FScheme last year, many people wanting
OL,14,Fto retire or cut back their hours have
OL,15,Fnot been able to receive payments.
OL,17,FThe National Audit Office said it would
OL,18,Flook at how the government managed the
OL,19,Ftransition from the previous company,
OL,20,FMyCSP, and the way the service has been
OL,21,Fadministered since December 2025.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
