OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACapita pension wait 'worst
OL,4,Aexperience of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCapita said it was "sorry for the
OL,7,Fimpact" the situation has had, while
OL,8,Fthe Cabinet Office said the "immediate
OL,9,Fpriority" was to stabilise service
OL,10,Flevels.
